very\n   recovered True leaders ['server-e7a4c635-4089-5839-3250-aa2e35eed0cd'] elapsed 513.4\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"cd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-13_10-13-13-hashicorp_raft-real-run/draft && python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nR=\\\"963b67610f634f0abcfc1d808093505c\\\"\nupd={\n \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Interpretation of the transfer reproduction receipt \\\"+R+\\\" (completed, exit_code 0) for the transfer investigation. Parsed events: index 0 and 1 are the voter-target control, and indices 2, 3 and 4 are the non-voter case (admission, outcome, recovery poll). The predicate evaluated is whether the reported outcome reproduces under a different schedule; the decisive elements do, and the one element that varies with schedule is recorded explicitly instead of being smoothed over. Both runs of the fixed experiment are cited with the compatibility reasoning for two receipts.\\\",\n \\\"interpretations\\\":[{\n  \\\"investigation_id\\\":\\\"2545a0aaffb2449e84b18c874a390441-question-0\\\",\n  \\\"experiment_id\\\":\\\"2545a0aaffb2449e84b18c874a390441-experiment\\\",\n  \\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"api-transfer-to-server\\\",\\\"initiate-transfer-check\\\",\\\"leaderloop-transfer-target\\\",\\\"startstop-replication-all-servers\\\",\\\"electself-voters-only\\\",\\\"requestvote-highterm-stepdown-nonvoter-reject\\\"],\n  \\\"executions\\\":{R:[2,3,4,0,1],\\\"79cf4ec11d694dfbaeb78ac8b07e1f67\\\":[2,3,4]}\n  } if False else {R:[2,3,4,0,1],\\\"79cf4ec11d694dfbaeb78ac8b07e1f67\\\":[2,3,4]},\n  \\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"holds\\\",\n  \\\"defect_claim\\\":\\\"asserted\\\",\n  \\\"knowledge\\\":[\n   {\\\"entry_id\\\":\\\"666afbbf5c5b4554bbfdd6bc26504c5e-knowledge-0\\\",\\\"revision\\\":1,\\\"assertion\\\":\\\"The AddVoter finding is unaffected; cited here only for the shared pattern of a successful future over a removed capability.\\\"},\n   {\\\"entry_id\\\":\\\"ef68857ce8804ccda0b53be4e95a8b7-knowledge-1\\\" if False else \\\"ef68857ce8804ccda0b53be4e95ea8b7-knowledge-1\\\",\\\"revision\\\":1,\\\"assertion\\\":\\\"The documented promise of graceful failure is not what the caller receives when the named target cannot be elected.\\\"}\n  ],\n  \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Admission (index 2): the leader's configuration contains the named server as a non-voter and the node had caught up, so the target is ineligible for leadership while being a legal cluster member. Outcome (index 3): the transfer future reports success (no error, 0.315 ms), the named target is a Follower at term 4 and never Leader, and the transfer-flagged vote campaign from the non-voter is visible at term 3 while the incumbent's own campaign at term 4 is visible afterwards. Recovery (index 4): one leader exists again about 513 ms after the call. Control (indices 0 and 1): the same call to a voter target succeeded and that target became Leader. Compared with the first run of this fixed experiment, the decisive elements recur - a successful future, no leadership for the named target, a term-advancing campaign by the non-voter that forces the voters to step down, and eventual recovery - while one element differs with scheduling: in the first run another voter became Leader at term 4, and here the deposed incumbent itself regained leadership at term 4, which is why its sampled state reads Leader in this receipt. That difference is schedule-dependent and does not affect the finding, which is about what the caller receives and about the incumbent having to re-elect: the sampled term of every voter advanced from 2 to 4 and the incumbent's own campaign is visible in the vote stream. Interpretation: the predicate 'the reported outcome reproduces under a different schedule' holds for the elements the finding rests on, and the varying element is recorded rather than hidden.\\\",\n  \\\"counterevidence\\\":[\n   \\\"The post-deposition leader identity is schedule-dependent (the incumbent here, another voter in the first run), so the receipt shows a re-election rather than a lasting vacancy; the harm is the unnecessary deposition and the misleading success, not an unrepaired cluster.\\\",\n   \\\"The reproduction uses the same staging, the same library build and the same in-memory timings, so it demonstrates schedule robustness rather than independence from the harness.\\\",\n   \\\"In this run the incumbent held leadership again by the time of the sample, so a reader who measured only the final state would not see the deposition; the term advance and the vote stream are what show it.\\\",\n   \\\"The non-voter case still requires the caller to name an ineligible target; the targetless path cannot select one.\\\"\n  ],\n  \\\"limitations\\\":[\n   \\\"One additional run of one fixed experiment, single process, in-memory transport, no faults, short timeouts.\\\",\n   \\\"The decisive deposition is evidenced here by term advances and the transient campaign in the vote stream rather than by a sampled vacancy, because the sampling interval did not catch the interval in which no leader existed.\\\",\n   \\\"The control and the non-voter case are separate cluster instances in the same execution, and the recovery poll is bounded.\\\",\n   \\\"Killers of the post-deposition interval are not resolved to the millisecond; only the sequence term 2 to term 4 within the run is claimed.\\\"\n  ],\n  \\\"joint_history\\\":\\\"Both receipts are runs of the same fixed experiment: the earlier one is its first run and this one is the repeat requested from the retained inputs, executed from a separate clean copy with identical inputs and independent scheduling. They are not fragments of one history; each is a complete run of the same harness, and they are cited together only to state what recurred and what varied.\\\",\n  \\\"report_title\\\":\\\"显式领导权转移指向非投票者的结果在独立调度下复现（后一任领导者身份随调度变化）\\\",\n  \\\"report_answer\\\":\\\"对领导权转移实验（固定实验 2545a0aaffb2449e84b18c874a390441）从保留输入再做一次干净复现，保留执行 \\\"+R+\\\" 显示与首次一致的关键事实：对一名非投票者调用 LeadershipTransferToServer 时，future 仍返回 nil（0.315 毫秒）；该命名目标始终只是 Follower、从未成为 Leader；投票流中可见该非投票者在 term 3 发起的带 transfer 标记的竞选，随后现任者自己在 term 4 竞选（说明其任期被推高、被迫重新选举）；约 513 毫秒后集群恢复单一领导者。对照（同一调用指向投票者）则成功完成转移。与首次运行的差异仅在于调度：首次是另一名投票者在 term 4 当选，本次是原现任者重新当选——这正是记录在案、随调度变化的元素。结论：『future 报成功、命名目标未获领导权、现任者被免职并被迫重新选举』这一账户在独立调度下复现；缺陷主张维持，术语与竞选流是该次运行证明免职的依据（采样未捕捉到无领导者的瞬时窗口）。\\\"\n }]\n}\nopen('update.json','w').write(json.dumps(upd,indent=2)+\\\"\\\\n\\\")\nprint('ok', json.load(open('update.json'))['interpretations'][0]['conclusion'])\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
